|> references appreciated.  Thanks.

The version(s) of OSF/1 that DEC incorporated into DEC OSF/1 used Mach 2.*
I seem to recall 2.5 specifically, but others may have crept in) as a basis,
coupled with BSD 4.4 (are what was expected to be BSD 4.4). It also has
a number of SVID II and SVID III features provided, though in the released
form you will still clearly know that you are not SVR4. Stability is good,
as is documentation.

- Marc
